                <p class="section-label">Going for good</p>
                <h2>Helping people and communities reclaim their digital future</h2>

                <div class="inner-cols-3">
                    <div>
                        <h3>Digital rents are increasing</h3>
                        <p>Market-leading online services are heavily subsidised by investor capital. And when that bargain ends the services get worse, the rent goes up, and inequalities are exacerbated.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3>Our regions are precarious</h3>
                        <p>We can't take connectivity, power, or corporate goodwill for granted. Climate events, isolation, and economic imbalances mean resilience has to be built locally.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3>Let's start with what we have</h3>
                        <p>Reclaiming Windows laptops is the entry point to start reimagining ownership today, while directing resources to training pathways and the wider vision.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

