        <p class="section-label">Where it's going</p>
        <h2>The mission</h2>
        <div class="inner-cols-3">
            <div>
                <h3>Phase 1 <span class="stock-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span></h3>
                <p>Collect, restore, reimagine, and redistribute ex-Windows 10 laptops. Automating the process and proving the value. Active now.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3>Phase 2 <span class="stock-dot stock-dot-amber" aria-hidden="true"></span></h3>
                <p>Offer qualification pathways for people who want to build, own, and operate resilient technologies. Seeking education partners.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3>Phase 3</h3>
                <p>Community partnerships, enterprise services, store presence. The full vision is documented in the original proposal.</p>
            </div>
